=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with {p:Gumbah} in {z:Bastok Mines} (J-7) HP #1 to begin the mission. He is inside the back room of the house on the upper walkway.
* Speak with {n:Dancing Wolf} in {z:Rabao} (G-6)/(G-7) near HP #2 for a cutscene.
* **(Optional)**: Go to {z:Rabao} (G-9) and speak to {n:Agado-Pugado} and {n:Rahi Fohlatti} for additional dialogue.
* Head to the (G-5) Entrance to {z:Quicksand Caves} in {z:Western Altepa Desert}.
** The {p:Survival Guide} to {z:Kuftal Tunnel} and exit into {z:Western Altepa Desert} is the fastest way.
** If you don't have the Survival Guide, {p:Unity Warp} 125 to Kuftal Tunnel, then Black Mage spell {s:Escape} takes you to the entrance of {z:Kuftal Tunnel}.
* Proceed to the weight trigger door at (H-8) then to (G-11) in {z:Quicksand Caves} to examine the **???** at the statue for a cutscene.
** Requires 1 Galka to open or a combination of other race. Hume Mithra and Elvan give 2/3 so you would need 2 players and Tarutaru give 1/3.
** You can open it without other players if you posses a {@k} {k:Loadstone}.
* Before leaving this area, it's recommended you continue to (C-8) and exit to {z:Western Altepa Desert} to press the sapphire column for opening the {q:Altepa Gate|Altepa Gate|Altepa Gate} in the subsequent mission.
* Head to the (D-12) entrance to {z:Quicksand Caves} in {z:Western Altepa Desert}.
** If you have it, the **{p:Proto-Waypoint}** warp to {z:Quicksand Caves} takes you to the correct map on the step below. Do not fall off!
* From (K-8) on Map 5, head to (H-8) on Map 6 passing through the entrance marked as D and touch the **???** at (H-8) to begin a confrontation with:
** 2 {m:Spelunking Sabotenders|Spelunking Sabotender} (MNK)
** 2 Sand Lizards
** 2 {m:Sand Tarantulas|Sand Tarantula} (WAR)
** Recommended to use trusts, Cactuars can use **1,000 Needles**.
** The monsters are resistant to {s:Sleep} and {p:Petrify}.
* Touch the **???** again afterwards for the final cutscene and your reward.

